    {
      "title": "\"Town Of The Dead Life\" emergency update notice 2021-01-14",
      "date": "2021-01-13 16:06:01",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4043637067847227007",
      "content": "[h1][b]Bug repair[/b][/h1]\n--The first time the game cannot enter battle repair\n--Abnormal repair of combat scene effect outside camp\n--Abnormal processing of food output data in initial exploration area\n\n[h1][b]Optimization and adjustment[/b][/h1]\n--City map and room exploration character movement speed improved\n--The daily food output of each survivor in the kitchen increased from 5/9/13/17/21 to 9/12/15/18/21\n--Novice guide to increase [right mouse button] use of items operation\n--Now zombies will gather after the first day to attack the camp\n\n[i]We have all seen your feedback on the game, whether it is to give us encouragement or to put forward our opinions and suggestions. Thank you for saying \"sorry\" to you. Although we have experienced a lot of tests before going online, there are still some omissions that have brought us a bad experience, which is not good enough for us I hope you can forgive me. Thank you[/i]"
    }
